WEBVTT


00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.946
What are you so scared of?


00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.917
If you move, you'll
get stabbed in the face.


00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.825
P-Please stop this!


00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:06.030
Dumb-ass. Stop crying.


00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.163
As punishment, we'll all
throw our knives at once.


00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.931
Ready, set...


00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:16.565
Cut that out!


00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:26.778
What if that kid gets
stabbed by your knives?


00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.187
Who are you?


00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:35.324
This is none of your business.


00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:39.326
Unfortunately, it is my business.


00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.832
You remember, don't you?


00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:47.202
Yu Hyuga. My little brother.


00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.842
You bullied him to death.


00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:53.941
I have no idea who that is.


00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.339
Oh, really?


00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:02.047
Even if you don't remember him,
he's waiting for you in hell!


00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.283
I'm gonna kill you!


00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:36.945
Stop screaming so pathetically.
You're a man, aren't you?


00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.585
You won't die from
getting your hand cut off.


00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:42.425
After all...


00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:45.428
I only have one arm too!


00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:17.156
I'll blast you to pieces!


00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:28.033
That thing is real! No fair!


00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.606
So what?


00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:19.525
Hey!


00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:28.522
Are you okay?


00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.861
You're safe now.


00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:34.926
Murderer... Murderer...


00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:37.002
Murderer!


00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:43.205
That's right. I am a murderer.


00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:49.072
But until a half year ago, I was
a normal high schooler who was able


00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:52.310
to hold her little
brother with her left arm.


00:05:55.455 --> 00:05:56.979
Here we go, Yoshie.


00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:58.558
<i>Six Months Ago
All right!</i>


00:05:58.558 --> 00:05:59.258
<i>Six Months Ago</i>


00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:01.283
<i>Six Months Ago
Wait up!</i>


00:06:03.363 --> 00:06:05.092
Wait, Ami!


00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:08.433
Wait! Wait!


00:06:10.169 --> 00:06:13.696
Nice shot! You're amazing, Ami!


00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:17.173
You're really something. So cool.


00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:20.742
If you were a boy,
I might have fallen for you.


00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:22.144
Stop it.


00:06:22.248 --> 00:06:25.479
I don't want a girl
to have a crush on me.


00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:30.083
But it looks like
it's not that way after all.


00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:31.123
How so?


00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.853
Because it looks
like you have a young fan.


00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:36.757
You're so popular!


00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:39.331
And he's so cute. I'm jealous.


00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:42.864
Dummy. That's my little brother, Yu.


00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:57.613
I'm impressed, Sis. I had no idea
you were so good at basketball.


00:06:57.717 --> 00:07:00.083
You're always lying around the house.


00:07:00.186 --> 00:07:01.380
Quiet, you.


00:07:02.588 --> 00:07:05.284
So why'd you stop by today?


00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:10.893
There's always something going on
when you come visit me like that.


00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:15.126
I'll pay you back, so please lend
me money to buy a new game!


00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:17.201
I knew it.


00:07:17.537 --> 00:07:18.595
No way.


00:07:19.071 --> 00:07:22.040
We don't have that
kind of money to spend.


00:07:22.141 --> 00:07:24.701
Sis, please. I really want it.


00:07:24.811 --> 00:07:28.042
I'll clean up every day,
even wash the dishes.


00:07:28.448 --> 00:07:30.643
Sis. Come on, Sis.


00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.517
Really?


00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:47.525
Yu.


00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.830
Takeshi, how much did you bring?


00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:54.566
I took 10,000 yen from my mom.


00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:56.938
I see. Me too.


00:07:58.311 --> 00:08:00.575
They're not gonna be happy.


00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:21.527
Hello, it's Yu.


00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:22.998
It's Takeshi.


00:08:23.102 --> 00:08:24.933
Excuse us.


00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:28.005
You're late.


00:08:28.107 --> 00:08:29.540
I'm sorry.


00:08:38.918 --> 00:08:40.385
Where's the money?


00:08:41.387 --> 00:08:44.015
Hurry up and hand it over.


00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:49.352
This isn't even half
of what we agreed on.


00:08:50.663 --> 00:08:51.960
Hey!


00:08:54.166 --> 00:08:55.428
Hey, Yu...


00:08:56.903 --> 00:08:59.133
How'd you get that money?


00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.138
I borrowed it from my sister.


00:09:08.781 --> 00:09:13.514
Then I expect you to get
more by tomorrow. 200,000 yen.


00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:20.351
If you can't, then I'll make your sister
work at my dad's whorehouse.


00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:22.927
She has nothing to do with this!


00:09:23.629 --> 00:09:26.359
Who do you think you are?


00:09:31.437 --> 00:09:33.268
Don't get me wrong.


00:09:33.372 --> 00:09:35.840
I don't really want your money.


00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:41.076
I just wanna have fun
by seeing you guys suffer.


00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:05.166
Teppei...
He's a peon, but he's cunning.


00:10:06.973 --> 00:10:10.101
Ryota Fujii... He's just a coward.


00:10:14.614 --> 00:10:18.072
But the one I hate most
is the leader, Sho Kimura.


00:10:19.585 --> 00:10:22.019
It's morning! Wake...


00:10:23.089 --> 00:10:24.886
Oh, you got up early.


00:10:26.225 --> 00:10:30.753
We're having fried chicken for
breakfast. They're still hot and tasty.


00:10:30.863 --> 00:10:31.852
Hot!


00:10:33.666 --> 00:10:36.430
Hey, what happened to your face?


00:10:36.769 --> 00:10:37.793
I fell.


00:10:37.903 --> 00:10:39.734
That can't be.


00:10:41.607 --> 00:10:42.835
Come back here.


00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:46.072
Yu, tell me the truth.


00:10:46.278 --> 00:10:49.076
Okay, I got into
a fight and got pummeled.


00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:50.978
You weren't bullied?


00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:56.248
No, I'm not that hopeless. I hit
a classmate who pissed me off.


00:10:56.455 --> 00:10:57.615
Watch it.


00:10:57.723 --> 00:11:01.022
You've done it now.
I won't go easy on you.


00:11:01.894 --> 00:11:06.593
You shouldn't use violence like that.
Remember what Dad used to say?


00:11:07.266 --> 00:11:08.324
Jeez.


00:11:10.269 --> 00:11:14.103
Violence doesn't solve anything.
It only hurts people.


00:11:15.041 --> 00:11:19.273
You and I fully understand that.


00:11:26.719 --> 00:11:30.985
When Mom and Dad killed
themselves over murder allegations,


00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.887
we promised then.


00:11:33.893 --> 00:11:36.225
Not to lose loved ones.


00:11:37.096 --> 00:11:39.826
To always be there for each other.


00:11:41.267 --> 00:11:44.930
No matter what happens,
I'm going to protect you.


00:11:46.172 --> 00:11:47.400
Sis...


00:12:22.441 --> 00:12:24.705
Listen, Sho.


00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:32.618
Whatever you do, do not ever bring
shame to our Hanzo Hattori clan.


00:12:36.555 --> 00:12:38.284
I know, Dad.


00:12:38.824 --> 00:12:47.027
We may be yakuza now,
but never lose your ninja pride.


00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.296
Never let your guard down.


00:12:51.403 --> 00:12:52.427
Never!


00:12:59.378 --> 00:13:01.846
Everyone except
yourself is an enemy!


00:13:02.581 --> 00:13:04.640
Think of them as slaves, right?


00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.842
That's right!


00:13:06.819 --> 00:13:08.616
Do not fear blades.


00:13:08.754 --> 00:13:11.120
Use them to destroy your enemy!


00:13:11.223 --> 00:13:13.418
Destroy! Destroy!


00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:17.695
Very good.


00:13:18.631 --> 00:13:21.293
You are my flesh and blood.


00:13:24.737 --> 00:13:27.467
I will make our bond even greater.


00:13:32.244 --> 00:13:34.439
A cup of my own blood.


00:13:34.947 --> 00:13:38.246
Drink it to strengthen our bond.


00:13:40.319 --> 00:13:41.786
Drink it...


00:13:41.887 --> 00:13:44.447
Drink more...


00:13:45.524 --> 00:13:48.084
Drink it...


00:13:50.796 --> 00:13:52.195
Sho...


00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:58.000
As long as you're around,
our clan will never die.


00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.670
You are my treasure!


00:14:06.745 --> 00:14:09.213
Master, your breakfast is ready.


00:14:12.384 --> 00:14:13.373
Hey.


00:14:14.653 --> 00:14:16.848
You must be new.


00:14:18.224 --> 00:14:23.423
How dare you interrupt our sacred
ritual between father and son?


00:14:24.063 --> 00:14:25.360
You!


00:14:28.934 --> 00:14:31.368
Young master, have a good day.


00:14:36.742 --> 00:14:39.302
Good morning, Mom.
What are you doing?


00:14:39.411 --> 00:14:41.276
Oh, good morning.


00:14:41.814 --> 00:14:46.217
This maid's been messing
up a lot, so I'm punishing her.


00:14:46.552 --> 00:14:48.179
Have a nice day.


00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:54.625
Have a nice day!


00:14:58.831 --> 00:15:01.561
She was a terrible maid.


00:15:03.869 --> 00:15:05.131
Bye-bye.


00:15:10.709 --> 00:15:12.404
Have a nice day.


00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:27.089
Where are you going?
School's the other way.


00:15:27.559 --> 00:15:29.220
Where's the money?


00:15:31.664 --> 00:15:34.098
Wait! Come back!


00:15:36.235 --> 00:15:37.998
What the hell?


00:15:38.103 --> 00:15:40.298
Watch where you're going!


00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:44.436
Come here, you! Come on!


00:15:45.344 --> 00:15:46.504
You open?


00:15:46.612 --> 00:15:47.874
Hello.


00:15:49.915 --> 00:15:52.475
Excuse me! Is Takeshi here?


00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.888
Hey! Wait! Who are you?


00:15:58.490 --> 00:16:02.449
What's wrong with kids these days?
They don't even say hello.


00:16:02.861 --> 00:16:05.352
Miki, do you know that kid?


00:16:06.265 --> 00:16:07.391
Miki?


00:16:11.437 --> 00:16:13.302
What was that?


00:16:15.941 --> 00:16:19.104
I'm scared... I'm scared...


00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:23.709
Those guys are... It's me.
We're in trouble. Run for it.


00:16:23.816 --> 00:16:24.783
What should we do?


00:16:24.783 --> 00:16:27.411
What should we do?
What do you want with Takeshi?


00:16:27.519 --> 00:16:28.387
Sorry...


00:16:28.387 --> 00:16:29.388
Sorry...
Ma, this is my friend, Yu Hyuga.


00:16:29.388 --> 00:16:31.288
Ma, this is my friend, Yu Hyuga.


00:16:33.926 --> 00:16:38.454
You're the son of
those alleged murderers.


00:16:38.897 --> 00:16:42.458
That's not true! My dad
was framed and killed himself.


00:16:42.601 --> 00:16:44.398
I don't care.


00:16:45.537 --> 00:16:48.028
Just stay away from my son.


00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:49.573
Go home!


00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.668
Takeshi? Takeshi!


00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:55.912
Takeshi, where are you going?


00:16:56.015 --> 00:16:57.277
Takeshi!


00:16:59.518 --> 00:17:00.085
Ready?


00:17:00.085 --> 00:17:01.052
Ready?
Okay.


00:17:01.153 --> 00:17:02.415
Go for it!


00:17:04.356 --> 00:17:07.621
You're amazing!
Nice shot! Just as I expected!


00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:11.993
I'm jealous of you. Seeing you
and Yu get along like that.


00:17:12.097 --> 00:17:15.658
He seems like a nice kid.
He must be easy to deal with.


00:17:15.768 --> 00:17:17.633
That's not true.


00:17:17.736 --> 00:17:21.536
He's very selfish.
I don't know what to do with him.


00:17:24.376 --> 00:17:25.570
This is bad!


00:17:27.379 --> 00:17:29.074
Y-Yoshie, excuse me.


00:17:29.181 --> 00:17:31.115
W-Wait, Ami!


00:17:31.216 --> 00:17:33.810
Where are you going? Jeez...


00:17:42.928 --> 00:17:44.020
Hold it!


00:17:44.863 --> 00:17:46.728
Where do you think you're going?


00:17:46.832 --> 00:17:48.959
Stop running away, man!


00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:00.679
Sorry...


00:18:00.679 --> 00:18:01.805
Sorry...
Hey.


00:18:02.014 --> 00:18:03.481
Where to, girl?


00:18:03.582 --> 00:18:04.844
I'm in a rush.


00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.942
What's the rush?
Where are you going?


00:18:08.053 --> 00:18:09.418
Stop!


00:18:12.458 --> 00:18:14.483
Who do you think you are?


00:18:15.127 --> 00:18:17.527
No! No! Stop!


00:18:17.629 --> 00:18:18.596
No!


00:18:20.766 --> 00:18:22.063
Stop...


00:18:22.167 --> 00:18:24.465
No! Stop!


00:18:29.374 --> 00:18:31.308
What are you thinking?


00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:33.377
You broke your promise.


00:18:34.046 --> 00:18:38.244
Do you know how embarrassing
this is for a yakuza's son?


00:18:48.894 --> 00:18:50.293
Stop!


00:18:50.662 --> 00:18:52.254
Stop!


00:19:00.105 --> 00:19:03.074
Beating on you two isn't much fun.


00:19:03.642 --> 00:19:06.611
I think I want Yu's sister to be my toy.


00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:10.845
I hear she's got big tits,
and she's cute. Go find her.


00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:18.013
Don't you dare lay
a finger on my sister!


00:19:30.602 --> 00:19:33.935
You sissies. You pissed me off.


00:19:35.407 --> 00:19:37.875
I won't take it easy on you!


00:19:37.976 --> 00:19:39.967
What the hell?


00:19:53.859 --> 00:19:55.224
Yu!


00:20:15.981 --> 00:20:19.473
You're pretty strong.
Is your sister strong too?


00:20:19.651 --> 00:20:21.414
She's much stronger!


00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:24.082
Then she should've trained you better.


00:20:33.632 --> 00:20:34.894
Takeshi...


00:20:37.502 --> 00:20:38.628
Are you okay?


00:20:38.737 --> 00:20:40.432
Yu, I'm scared...


00:20:42.107 --> 00:20:43.438
Shut up!


00:20:47.179 --> 00:20:48.840
Takeshi!


00:20:49.615 --> 00:20:50.877
Takeshi!


00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:00.717
See ya.


00:21:14.706 --> 00:21:15.832
Sis...


00:21:21.413 --> 00:21:22.380
Yu?


00:21:31.823 --> 00:21:33.120
Yu...


00:21:34.626 --> 00:21:35.923
Yu!


00:22:03.655 --> 00:22:04.679
Yu...


00:22:05.724 --> 00:22:07.055
Yu...


00:22:07.993 --> 00:22:10.393
This is some kind of joke, right?


00:22:40.058 --> 00:22:40.692
<i>Sugihara Motors</i>


00:22:40.692 --> 00:22:43.024
<i>Sugihara Motors</i>


00:22:53.171 --> 00:22:54.468
Takeshi...


00:22:56.541 --> 00:22:58.907
Why did you have to go?


00:23:00.979 --> 00:23:02.139
Takeshi...


00:23:03.415 --> 00:23:04.382
Takeshi...


00:23:04.449 --> 00:23:05.250
Excuse me.


00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:06.808
Excuse me.
Takeshi...


00:23:19.831 --> 00:23:21.162
Who are you?


00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.991
I'm Yu's older sister.


00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:28.464
I'm so sorry about Takeshi...


00:23:29.508 --> 00:23:31.135
What do you want?


00:23:31.643 --> 00:23:34.840
The police are trying
to call it a suicide.


00:23:36.181 --> 00:23:40.311
But I know someone was
responsible for their deaths.


00:23:42.354 --> 00:23:44.083
If only I had a lead...


00:23:44.256 --> 00:23:45.416
Stop it.


00:23:46.391 --> 00:23:49.690
I don't want you playing the victim.


00:23:50.095 --> 00:23:51.153
Look.


00:23:51.963 --> 00:23:57.128
If it weren't for your brother,
Takeshi would still be alive!


00:23:58.403 --> 00:23:59.495
But...


00:24:00.138 --> 00:24:02.572
You people are murderers.


00:24:02.741 --> 00:24:05.733
Your family brings misfortune
to everyone around you!


00:24:05.811 --> 00:24:06.971
Stop it!


00:24:07.379 --> 00:24:08.812
Get out of here!


00:24:08.914 --> 00:24:10.108
Miki.


00:24:19.291 --> 00:24:27.062
Neither Yu, Dad, nor I
would ever kill anyone...


00:24:36.174 --> 00:24:38.904
There's no way Yu would kill himself.


00:24:40.946 --> 00:24:42.379
No way.


00:24:45.150 --> 00:24:47.880
Someone forced him into it.


00:24:49.287 --> 00:24:51.551
Someone must've killed him!


00:25:12.210 --> 00:25:14.804
"People I want to kill."


00:25:15.780 --> 00:25:17.213
What is this?


00:25:19.584 --> 00:25:22.075
Why didn't I find out sooner?


00:25:25.156 --> 00:25:26.282
Yu...


00:25:26.925 --> 00:25:28.290
I'm sorry!


00:25:54.619 --> 00:25:55.813
I'm sorry.


00:25:56.254 --> 00:26:00.190
I'm not sure about tempura
in the morning. Is it okay?


00:26:16.775 --> 00:26:20.802
The incident with your
brother breaks my heart.


00:26:20.912 --> 00:26:23.779
I'm sad since I was his friend.


00:26:26.084 --> 00:26:30.043
Ryota, who's the leader of the group?


00:26:32.123 --> 00:26:35.320
Ryota needs to get to school, so...


00:26:37.429 --> 00:26:38.453
Wait.


00:26:38.763 --> 00:26:41.789
Well, I'm going.
Make yourself at home.


00:26:43.168 --> 00:26:44.328
So...


00:26:46.071 --> 00:26:51.031
Are you saying that our
Ryota bullied your brother?


00:26:54.212 --> 00:26:56.180
This diary is proof.


00:26:57.115 --> 00:27:00.482
I'd like you to come to
the police precinct with me.


00:27:00.585 --> 00:27:02.280
You're an idiot!


00:27:03.722 --> 00:27:08.716
We've been in the police business
ever since my grandfather's time.


00:27:10.729 --> 00:27:12.697
You're Hyuga, right?


00:27:13.665 --> 00:27:17.032
I know that your father is a murderer.


00:27:18.803 --> 00:27:21.670
Trying to falsely accuse my son...


00:27:24.476 --> 00:27:26.444
What do you want?


00:27:27.278 --> 00:27:29.303
Murderer!


00:27:31.750 --> 00:27:32.808
What?


00:27:35.253 --> 00:27:38.689
If he was being bullied,


00:27:39.658 --> 00:27:43.458
maybe it was because something
was wrong with your brother.


00:27:43.561 --> 00:27:47.497
I don't want you blaming us
for your brother's problems.


00:27:51.670 --> 00:27:53.103
Please stop.


00:27:54.673 --> 00:27:56.698
I want to talk calmly.


00:27:56.808 --> 00:27:58.537
I can't talk to you.


00:27:58.943 --> 00:28:05.007
A minx like you should be arrested!


00:28:12.357 --> 00:28:15.793
Stop!
There's no need for this violence!


00:28:15.894 --> 00:28:19.489
I'm doing this to protect my son!


00:28:27.205 --> 00:28:28.365
Please stop!


00:28:59.270 --> 00:29:01.363
It's hot!


00:29:10.014 --> 00:29:13.211
Oh, it fried up very nicely.


00:29:13.485 --> 00:29:15.248
Such tasty tempura.


00:29:20.959 --> 00:29:23.826
Hot! Hot! Hot!


00:29:30.401 --> 00:29:32.096
Damn it!


00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:33.767
H-Honey!


00:29:36.407 --> 00:29:38.466
Honey, are you okay?


00:29:40.445 --> 00:29:42.572
Don't call the cops.


00:29:43.047 --> 00:29:47.108
I'll find her and finish her off!


00:29:56.094 --> 00:29:57.288
It stings...


00:29:57.395 --> 00:29:58.657
Oh, it stings...


00:29:58.763 --> 00:30:00.025
It stings.


00:30:00.498 --> 00:30:01.931
l-It stings...


00:30:02.033 --> 00:30:03.694
Ow...


00:30:04.002 --> 00:30:05.560
Ow...


00:30:29.360 --> 00:30:30.418
Stop.


00:30:30.995 --> 00:30:34.021
If you make a noise, I'll slit your throat.


00:30:34.132 --> 00:30:38.330
Now apologize to Yu
and tell me who your leader is.


00:30:38.436 --> 00:30:39.664
I don't know.


00:30:42.207 --> 00:30:47.144
I'll tell you. The leader is
a yakuza's son, Sho Kimura!


00:30:47.545 --> 00:30:49.513
Sho Kimura?


00:30:52.050 --> 00:30:55.076
I can't breathe... Murderer...


00:30:55.920 --> 00:30:59.549
I always believed that it was
wrong to kill no matter what.


00:31:00.391 --> 00:31:03.918
But I learned from your parents


00:31:05.296 --> 00:31:07.890
that there's a time and place for it!


00:31:19.677 --> 00:31:21.042
A blackout?


00:32:26.311 --> 00:32:28.438
Ryota!


00:32:58.076 --> 00:33:02.206
I hope you rot in hell together!


00:33:10.421 --> 00:33:14.084
Mother, there's
no conditioner. Can you get some?


00:33:15.460 --> 00:33:19.191
Sir, how about
an unusual conditioner?


00:33:21.099 --> 00:33:23.966
It can't be... you!


00:33:29.774 --> 00:33:33.540
Ryota!


00:33:33.644 --> 00:33:36.442
Wash your hair with your son's blood!


00:33:40.118 --> 00:33:42.643
Ryota!


00:33:47.458 --> 00:33:48.789
Ryota?


00:33:49.460 --> 00:33:51.928
Please, God!


00:33:56.367 --> 00:33:58.130
Serves you right.


00:34:09.614 --> 00:34:13.345
I'm a demon! I turned into a demon!


00:34:19.857 --> 00:34:24.385
I'll remain a demon until I kill
every last one of Yu's enemies!


00:34:34.338 --> 00:34:35.896
Delicious.


00:34:46.084 --> 00:34:48.109
Here are your noodles and soup...


00:34:48.219 --> 00:34:50.380
Hot!


00:34:50.655 --> 00:34:53.590
Hey! What do you think you're doing?


00:34:54.659 --> 00:34:57.253
What'll you do
about the master's leg?


00:34:57.361 --> 00:35:00.228
I don't like that look on your face!


00:35:02.967 --> 00:35:04.025
Hey!


00:35:07.171 --> 00:35:10.004
Keep it down.


00:35:21.652 --> 00:35:23.586
Sorry about that.


00:35:25.857 --> 00:35:28.951
You must be the new chef, right?


00:35:29.160 --> 00:35:30.286
Yes...


00:35:30.495 --> 00:35:32.190
Got kids?


00:35:32.296 --> 00:35:33.263
No.


00:35:36.734 --> 00:35:38.895
Kids are great.


00:35:40.071 --> 00:35:46.909
I did a lot of bad things in
my life, but my kids need me.


00:35:50.982 --> 00:35:53.644
Sho means everything to me.


00:35:54.685 --> 00:35:56.846
I live because of him.


00:35:58.923 --> 00:36:02.290
And you caused him great pain...


00:36:04.562 --> 00:36:07.622
Cut off a finger as an apology!


00:36:08.933 --> 00:36:10.525
Please forgive me!


00:36:14.906 --> 00:36:18.239
Honey, that's not right.


00:36:18.743 --> 00:36:21.268
You always do this.


00:36:22.180 --> 00:36:24.580
I'm really sorry about all this.


00:36:27.752 --> 00:36:29.344
You're too soft!


00:36:31.656 --> 00:36:37.060
Even all five fingers wouldn't
be enough to make it up to Sho!


00:36:38.629 --> 00:36:42.565
I am formerly of the Kanto Beasts!
Don't fuck with me!


00:36:43.935 --> 00:36:45.300
No!


00:36:45.736 --> 00:36:48.432
If you don't want to die,


00:36:50.007 --> 00:36:54.467
then at least apologize like
the true chef you are, huh?


00:37:01.919 --> 00:37:05.616
Excuse me. I want
to ask you for directions.


00:37:06.157 --> 00:37:08.125
Where do you need to go?


00:37:08.993 --> 00:37:10.654
Where's Sho Kimura?


00:37:11.395 --> 00:37:13.260
Take me to him!


00:37:16.234 --> 00:37:16.367
Now, eat some sushi...


00:37:16.367 --> 00:37:19.928
Now, eat some sushi...


00:37:21.505 --> 00:37:24.736
Eat as much as you want...


00:37:29.614 --> 00:37:31.775
Go ahead and eat.


00:37:34.285 --> 00:37:36.219
If you say so...


00:37:42.727 --> 00:37:45.855
How do your fingers taste?


00:37:49.367 --> 00:37:52.234
We need a new
chef starting tomorrow.


00:37:52.803 --> 00:37:54.862
I'm going to the bathroom.


00:38:20.898 --> 00:38:22.525
You're Sho Kimura?


00:38:23.167 --> 00:38:25.135
Who the hell are you?


00:38:25.236 --> 00:38:27.261
What was that sound?


00:38:27.438 --> 00:38:28.496
Sho!


00:38:29.607 --> 00:38:31.768
Who the hell are you?


00:38:32.076 --> 00:38:34.442
Stay back or I'll slit his throat.


00:38:34.545 --> 00:38:38.174
I'm not afraid to die.
I just want to kill him.


00:38:41.285 --> 00:38:44.049
No way. You can't kill me.


00:38:44.822 --> 00:38:46.016
What's that?


00:38:49.827 --> 00:38:51.886
You won't get away! Someone!


00:38:51.996 --> 00:38:53.156
Right!


00:39:08.379 --> 00:39:10.404
She's good.


00:39:48.419 --> 00:39:49.784
You...


00:39:50.988 --> 00:39:53.047
You killed my Yu!


00:39:59.764 --> 00:40:00.890
Go through!


00:40:13.944 --> 00:40:19.644
You did pretty good for a girl.


00:40:21.519 --> 00:40:23.646
But it's over now.


00:40:24.488 --> 00:40:27.946
I'm sure you know what's
going to happen to you, right?


00:40:49.580 --> 00:40:52.947
Yu's sister, I feel sorry for you.


00:40:53.217 --> 00:40:55.048
You were so close.


00:40:55.853 --> 00:41:00.381
Wounds from burns and a katana.
Your arm is a mess, girl.


00:41:02.560 --> 00:41:07.725
We, the Hattori clan, won't kill
our enemy after they're captured.


00:41:09.767 --> 00:41:14.932
We give them a taste
of hell before killing them.


00:41:16.407 --> 00:41:22.073
I thought your stupid
son was the crazy one,


00:41:24.415 --> 00:41:28.749
but you're all insane!


00:41:31.889 --> 00:41:35.256
You have pretty fingers...


00:41:37.628 --> 00:41:42.292
I can't believe these belong
to such a strong girl like you...


00:41:43.534 --> 00:41:48.801
Slice, slice, slice these fingers off...


00:41:50.207 --> 00:41:52.675
O great Hanzo Hattori.


00:41:52.776 --> 00:41:57.236
Provide this girl with
great pain and suffering.


00:42:05.089 --> 00:42:06.920
It hurts!


00:42:11.795 --> 00:42:16.255
That was for all three of us.


00:42:18.168 --> 00:42:20.500
But we're not done yet.


00:42:22.139 --> 00:42:25.836
Now this is from the great Hanzo!


00:42:36.153 --> 00:42:39.645
It looks pretty nice without any fingers.


00:42:42.893 --> 00:42:45.862
I think that's enough for today.


00:42:46.030 --> 00:42:47.622
One minute.


00:42:48.566 --> 00:42:49.760
Wait.


00:42:51.035 --> 00:42:53.595
You should keep going, honey!


00:42:53.704 --> 00:42:58.505
Torture isn't fun unless
you do it a little bit at a time.


00:42:59.209 --> 00:43:03.669
That's why you're too soft.
You should finish her off at once!


00:43:03.781 --> 00:43:06.272
You shut up and let me do my job!


00:43:46.724 --> 00:43:49.192
I'm gonna give you a painkiller.


00:43:49.727 --> 00:43:51.718
The boss is being kind.


00:43:52.830 --> 00:43:57.392
It's a shame you're
gonna be hacked up tomorrow.


00:43:59.870 --> 00:44:02.771
Such a nice body.


00:44:06.076 --> 00:44:09.807
Give me the key
to unlock this chain! Now!


00:44:17.521 --> 00:44:19.614
What is this?


00:44:20.257 --> 00:44:22.691
Shit. She escaped.


00:44:23.861 --> 00:44:26.125
Hey! Someone!


00:44:28.032 --> 00:44:29.431
What's wrong?


00:44:29.533 --> 00:44:30.864
That girl...


00:44:34.905 --> 00:44:38.397
That bitch... Where did she go?


00:44:42.579 --> 00:44:45.377
Like I said,
you were too easy on her!


00:44:46.884 --> 00:44:51.218
Find her and kill her.


00:45:29.359 --> 00:45:30.417
Yu...


00:45:31.595 --> 00:45:34.063
Where are you taking me?


00:46:03.627 --> 00:46:05.151
Don't overdo it.


00:46:05.262 --> 00:46:09.198
You won't be able to work
efficiently even if you work overtime.


00:46:09.299 --> 00:46:10.234
I'll take over.


00:46:10.234 --> 00:46:11.724
I'll take over.
Don't.


00:46:13.370 --> 00:46:15.565
I want to keep working.


00:46:17.241 --> 00:46:22.304
If I stop working for even a bit,
I start to think about Takeshi.


00:46:23.313 --> 00:46:24.541
I see...


00:46:35.125 --> 00:46:36.490
Hey, Miki!


00:46:36.593 --> 00:46:38.618
Someone's collapsed outside!


00:46:38.729 --> 00:46:40.697
Hey! Are you okay?


00:46:40.798 --> 00:46:43.232
Hey! Hey! Hey!


00:46:44.968 --> 00:46:46.333
Hey, Miki...


00:46:46.837 --> 00:46:48.771
Are you okay? Hey!


00:46:50.040 --> 00:46:50.274
Hey!


00:46:50.274 --> 00:46:52.174
Hey!
This girl...


00:47:05.522 --> 00:47:08.719
Are you sure you
know what you're doing?


00:47:09.760 --> 00:47:12.194
Yeah. Don't worry.


00:47:13.297 --> 00:47:15.629
I'm the son of a doctor.


00:47:17.201 --> 00:47:22.571
When I was in the biker gang, I fixed
up buddies who got hurt in fights.


00:47:24.141 --> 00:47:25.540
Including you.


00:47:27.144 --> 00:47:31.706
Hey, you're going to throw her
out when she wakes up, right?


00:47:32.216 --> 00:47:35.208
I don't want to get
dragged into anything.


00:47:36.987 --> 00:47:39.888
Even if it has something
to do with Takeshi's death?


00:47:41.091 --> 00:47:44.754
I'm sure she's like this
because she discovered the truth.


00:47:45.629 --> 00:47:47.893
It's not safe for her out there.


00:47:47.998 --> 00:47:50.865
So you want to keep her here?


00:47:51.935 --> 00:47:53.197
No way.


00:47:55.739 --> 00:47:58.207
You have nothing against her, right?


00:48:02.312 --> 00:48:04.143
Hey, are you okay?


00:48:13.056 --> 00:48:14.353
You...


00:48:25.168 --> 00:48:26.533
I'm home.


00:48:37.714 --> 00:48:40.774
No! Who are you people?


00:48:40.884 --> 00:48:42.749
No! Get off of me!


00:48:50.661 --> 00:48:52.891
Sorry to barge in.


00:48:54.831 --> 00:48:59.859
We hear that you're
best friends with Ami Hyuga.


00:49:02.039 --> 00:49:06.135
Is she here?


00:49:07.144 --> 00:49:11.604
I don't know what you're
talking about. She's not here!


00:49:12.983 --> 00:49:15.543
I'm not involved with anything!


00:49:18.155 --> 00:49:20.419
I don't know any Ami.


00:49:21.291 --> 00:49:23.054
I don't know her!


00:49:23.160 --> 00:49:24.923
I see.


00:49:26.163 --> 00:49:28.324
I apologize then.


00:49:29.700 --> 00:49:32.464
She wasn't here after all, huh?


00:49:32.703 --> 00:49:37.140
Then we have to keep
you quiet about all this.


00:49:55.559 --> 00:50:01.054
Hey, why don't you do it with her?


00:50:01.631 --> 00:50:02.598
Right.


00:50:02.699 --> 00:50:07.102
It's not often that
you get to do a college girl.


00:50:13.010 --> 00:50:15.740
Where the hell did she go?


00:50:35.532 --> 00:50:38.831
You can eat a rice ball
with one hand, right? Here.


00:50:42.773 --> 00:50:45.537
So what you told us is true?


00:50:46.443 --> 00:50:49.105
Takeshi was killed by a yakuza's son?


00:50:49.212 --> 00:50:51.840
I wouldn't have lost
my arm if it weren't true.


00:50:51.948 --> 00:50:54.883
Who and where is he? Tell me!


00:50:54.985 --> 00:50:59.820
Shut up. I thought you didn't want
to have anything to do with me.


00:51:00.023 --> 00:51:03.550
Is that how you talk
to people who saved your life?


00:51:04.895 --> 00:51:08.831
You told me once
not to play the victim.


00:51:09.466 --> 00:51:11.991
Well, right back at you!


00:51:23.547 --> 00:51:25.242
Now you did it.


00:51:25.816 --> 00:51:30.549
I don't give a damn
if you only have one arm!


00:51:38.395 --> 00:51:41.091
Hey... What are you doing, Miki?


00:51:41.198 --> 00:51:43.428
She hasn't recovered yet.


00:51:43.533 --> 00:51:45.330
Please don't stop us.


00:51:45.969 --> 00:51:50.201
No matter what shape I'm in,
I just want to settle this.


00:51:51.675 --> 00:51:54.940
It's a battle between those
who've lost loved ones.


00:52:16.500 --> 00:52:18.695
The loser will be covered in blood.


00:52:22.873 --> 00:52:24.500
I can't lose.


00:52:25.408 --> 00:52:32.439
No matter what happens to my body,
I have to seek revenge for Yu's sake!


00:52:32.782 --> 00:52:34.147
Me too.


00:52:35.352 --> 00:52:39.846
I'm furious with myself for not
being able to protect Takeshi!


00:52:53.370 --> 00:52:54.337
Ow!


00:52:57.707 --> 00:52:59.140
Are you okay?


00:53:00.577 --> 00:53:05.640
Ami, you're pretty good
even if you only have one arm.


00:53:07.984 --> 00:53:10.919
You came at me
with everything you had.


00:53:11.388 --> 00:53:12.821
I like that.


00:53:14.024 --> 00:53:18.518
Mind if I join you
in getting your revenge?


00:53:19.296 --> 00:53:21.594
You'll be with a murderer.


00:53:21.865 --> 00:53:23.196
Are you sure?


00:53:23.767 --> 00:53:25.758
They're my enemies too.


00:53:26.269 --> 00:53:30.228
Besides, if there's a way to get
revenge by not killing people,


00:53:30.340 --> 00:53:32.638
then I'd like to know it.


00:53:33.710 --> 00:53:36.372
It's kill, kill, kill.


00:53:50.393 --> 00:53:54.022
Ami, it must be hard
to fight with that kind of body.


00:53:54.898 --> 00:53:57.093
I'll make you a new arm.


00:53:57.467 --> 00:53:59.492
One made of steel.


00:54:37.173 --> 00:54:40.165
You think you can
avenge your brother like that?


00:54:40.277 --> 00:54:43.474
He won't be able
to rest in peace, you idiot!


00:54:50.453 --> 00:54:51.087
It's tough!


00:54:51.087 --> 00:54:53.647
It's tough!
This training is for moving forward!


00:54:53.757 --> 00:54:56.317
You didn't even move a millimeter.


00:54:56.993 --> 00:54:58.756
Come on! Keep going!


00:55:20.550 --> 00:55:22.040
Cute face.


00:55:22.619 --> 00:55:24.814
Those are the eyes. Remember that!


00:55:38.034 --> 00:55:39.831
Can I help you?


00:55:41.738 --> 00:55:44.434
The Kimuras moved away recently.


00:55:45.408 --> 00:55:46.242
Where?


00:55:46.242 --> 00:55:48.574
Where?
How should I know?


00:55:48.712 --> 00:55:51.510
But I'm glad the yakuza are gone.


00:55:52.282 --> 00:55:53.374
Thank you.


00:56:16.139 --> 00:56:17.265
Suguru?


00:56:18.174 --> 00:56:19.539
Oh, Ami.


00:56:21.010 --> 00:56:22.534
I'm almost done.


00:56:23.613 --> 00:56:26.275
Thank you... for everything.


00:56:28.251 --> 00:56:31.311
I hope you'll stay friends with my wife.


00:56:33.690 --> 00:56:36.887
She can't have any more kids.


00:56:38.828 --> 00:56:43.094
I wasn't able to understand her pain.


00:56:44.734 --> 00:56:45.894
But, Ami...


00:56:46.636 --> 00:56:50.072
She was saved by meeting you.


00:56:51.841 --> 00:56:54.833
So please take good care of her.


00:56:57.013 --> 00:56:58.139
I will.


00:57:00.049 --> 00:57:02.347
Ami! We have a problem!


00:57:02.752 --> 00:57:04.481
The Kimura family's gone.


00:57:04.554 --> 00:57:05.521
What?


00:57:05.622 --> 00:57:07.556
They're up to something.


00:57:07.657 --> 00:57:10.455
Hey, do you hear a strange noise?


00:57:24.741 --> 00:57:26.075
The machine gun...


00:57:26.075 --> 00:57:27.372
The machine gun...
Okay!


00:57:32.335 --> 00:57:35.634
All right, calm down... Calm down...


00:57:41.778 --> 00:57:42.802
We are


00:57:46.616 --> 00:57:49.608
the Junior High Shuriken Gang!


00:57:59.362 --> 00:58:00.420
Whoa.


00:58:01.231 --> 00:58:04.029
Takeshi's house is really dirty.


00:58:06.770 --> 00:58:11.036
Excuse me, but could
you stop wandering around?


00:58:12.075 --> 00:58:14.908
Your family members
died on their own,


00:58:15.011 --> 00:58:17.377
so don't hold a grudge against us.


00:58:17.481 --> 00:58:19.711
Honestly, it's disturbing.


00:58:20.450 --> 00:58:24.216
I'm going to kill that bastard!


00:58:25.188 --> 00:58:27.452
You stupid brat.


00:58:28.925 --> 00:58:30.552
You're gonna get it!


00:59:09.099 --> 00:59:11.363
We might get killed first!


00:59:25.816 --> 00:59:26.783
The wire...


00:59:29.553 --> 00:59:32.522
Honey, is that
machine gun finished yet?


00:59:33.223 --> 00:59:36.090
Hang on! I just have
to attach the trigger!


01:00:11.761 --> 01:00:14.855
Aw, looks like it's over now.


01:00:17.267 --> 01:00:18.928
Damn it...


01:00:23.740 --> 01:00:26.675
It went in! Yes! It's done!


01:00:29.613 --> 01:00:31.240
I'm finished...


01:00:36.553 --> 01:00:38.646
Ami! Take it!


01:01:27.370 --> 01:01:29.201
Honey!


01:01:30.473 --> 01:01:32.236
Honey! Honey!


01:02:10.246 --> 01:02:11.713
Shit...


01:02:11.781 --> 01:02:13.305
She's pretty good...


01:02:21.524 --> 01:02:22.684
I'm hit!


01:02:34.371 --> 01:02:36.839
Mommy...


01:02:36.973 --> 01:02:39.032
Mommy...


01:03:06.536 --> 01:03:09.664
Honey! Honey...


01:03:12.008 --> 01:03:13.600
Honey...


01:03:14.277 --> 01:03:16.211
No!


01:03:17.747 --> 01:03:21.410
Honey! Honey!


01:03:24.087 --> 01:03:25.384
Honey...


01:03:25.488 --> 01:03:27.149
Suguru...


01:03:35.432 --> 01:03:38.367
Takashi! Takashi! Takashi!


01:03:47.310 --> 01:03:51.770
Damn it... Who killed my son?


01:03:56.152 --> 01:04:00.145
I'll never forgive... Who killed him?


01:04:01.691 --> 01:04:04.057
I'm sorry about your loss.


01:04:08.231 --> 01:04:11.223
I know who killed your sons.


01:04:13.369 --> 01:04:16.202
Do you want me to help you?


01:04:45.869 --> 01:04:48.167
There's no point hiding here.


01:04:48.938 --> 01:04:54.535
My boss will find you two
and send out an assassin.


01:04:57.814 --> 01:04:59.805
I'm not running away.


01:05:00.250 --> 01:05:02.810
I'm just waiting for
my chance for revenge.


01:05:05.488 --> 01:05:09.618
Stop bluffing and
give me something to eat.


01:05:10.093 --> 01:05:14.689
I'm hungry. I'm really hungry.


01:05:15.765 --> 01:05:19.565
If I kill you, then I won't know
where to find the Kimuras.


01:05:19.669 --> 01:05:22.467
So I'll let you live for now!


01:05:22.639 --> 01:05:24.504
Here's a rice ball.


01:05:25.241 --> 01:05:26.469
Eat it.


01:05:27.911 --> 01:05:29.242
Come on.


01:05:34.851 --> 01:05:35.875
Thanks.


01:05:37.187 --> 01:05:41.180
But that kindness
happens to be your weakness.


01:05:48.264 --> 01:05:51.097
Thank you for coming.


01:05:54.037 --> 01:06:00.465
I know that you have all lost
your children for no good reason.


01:06:03.446 --> 01:06:07.644
Your enemies will surely come here.


01:06:09.752 --> 01:06:15.019
I want to help you get your revenge!


01:06:18.561 --> 01:06:21.860
We're going to kill those women!


01:06:26.903 --> 01:06:28.837
Ryota!


01:06:36.145 --> 01:06:37.510
Damn...


01:06:38.681 --> 01:06:41.775
I can't believe I screwed up...


01:06:47.090 --> 01:06:48.114
Ami.


01:06:48.458 --> 01:06:51.359
Did you find out
where the Kimuras are?


01:06:52.629 --> 01:06:54.824
I really want to kill them.


01:06:57.734 --> 01:06:58.758
Miki?


01:07:00.270 --> 01:07:02.465
Miki, let me take a look.


01:07:02.872 --> 01:07:03.861
No...


01:07:05.775 --> 01:07:07.572
It looks bad...


01:07:09.879 --> 01:07:12.404
Her wound is getting infected.


01:07:12.982 --> 01:07:16.383
She'll die if you don't
get her to a hospital.


01:07:18.288 --> 01:07:21.553
Miki... You can't fight like this.


01:07:22.358 --> 01:07:26.021
Let's go to the nearest
hospital to get you fixed up.


01:07:26.529 --> 01:07:28.190
Wait a minute...


01:07:28.498 --> 01:07:32.298
You want to go without me?
You've gotta be kidding me.


01:07:33.903 --> 01:07:37.634
I can't just relax without
getting my revenge!


01:07:38.074 --> 01:07:39.166
No!


01:07:42.312 --> 01:07:43.643
Miki?


01:07:45.214 --> 01:07:46.738
I...


01:07:48.151 --> 01:07:50.711
I don't want you to die.


01:07:53.289 --> 01:07:57.521
I'll be the one to die
after getting our revenge.


01:08:05.368 --> 01:08:08.235
So I don't want you to die.


01:08:10.807 --> 01:08:13.469
I lost everyone I loved.


01:08:15.478 --> 01:08:18.072
I have no more hope left.


01:08:20.083 --> 01:08:23.314
But after I met you,


01:08:23.953 --> 01:08:28.356
I was able to understand
what it's like to protect someone.


01:08:30.460 --> 01:08:31.620
Miki.


01:08:33.229 --> 01:08:37.893
You're the only one who
means something to me now.


01:08:43.473 --> 01:08:46.067
Thanks, Ami.


01:08:48.010 --> 01:08:50.911
But I lost my husband and Takeshi.


01:08:52.548 --> 01:08:54.709
I'm as good as dead.


01:08:57.120 --> 01:09:03.548
If I don't crush the Kimuras,
then they'll never rest in peace.


01:09:07.296 --> 01:09:08.627
Ami...


01:09:14.070 --> 01:09:17.665
Ami, I'm begging you.


01:09:20.910 --> 01:09:26.177
Please let me die in peace.


01:09:30.153 --> 01:09:31.518
Miki...


01:09:36.392 --> 01:09:37.518
Come on.


01:09:38.161 --> 01:09:40.356
We don't have much time.


01:09:40.963 --> 01:09:43.523
Tell me where the Kimuras are hiding.


01:09:46.769 --> 01:09:50.762
I'm not going to tell you
even if you bash my head in!


01:09:50.873 --> 01:09:52.067
I see.


01:09:56.512 --> 01:09:59.140
Hey, what are you doing?


01:09:59.515 --> 01:10:01.483
Stop messing around...


01:10:03.052 --> 01:10:05.111
Stop! Stop!


01:10:05.521 --> 01:10:06.852
Stop it...


01:10:09.492 --> 01:10:11.722
You nailed me!


01:10:12.128 --> 01:10:14.187
Using a nail isn't fair!


01:10:14.297 --> 01:10:16.458
Stop complaining.


01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:20.969
We're risking our lives, you know!


01:10:23.806 --> 01:10:26.138
Miki, let's go.


01:10:27.176 --> 01:10:30.976
Let's go on a journey to hell
in order to kill the Kimuras!


01:10:34.584 --> 01:10:39.612
It's time to get your revenge.


01:11:42.952 --> 01:11:45.978
This is too much! No more!


01:11:47.123 --> 01:11:52.755
The Kimuras have
a hideout at Ichinooka Shrine.


01:11:53.729 --> 01:11:55.697
Ichinooka Shrine?


01:12:09.478 --> 01:12:12.174
This is the way
to Ichinooka Shrine, right?


01:12:12.281 --> 01:12:17.241
Ami, if you can't use your machine
gun, use the weapons in this bag.


01:12:18.588 --> 01:12:21.386
We're running short
on machine-gun bullets.


01:12:21.490 --> 01:12:23.287
You can use...


01:12:24.427 --> 01:12:25.416
This.


01:12:25.795 --> 01:12:28.263
This bullet is very powerful.


01:12:29.065 --> 01:12:31.431
It's nothing like the other ones.


01:12:32.168 --> 01:12:34.796
Use it to finish your opponent.


01:12:34.971 --> 01:12:39.431
It's got too much power and might
just destroy your machine gun.


01:12:41.477 --> 01:12:44.640
Think of it as
a last present from Suguru.


01:12:45.581 --> 01:12:46.639
Okay.


01:12:50.219 --> 01:12:55.555
Even with a weapon like that,
the two of you are gonna get killed.


01:12:57.159 --> 01:13:00.822
But it's impressive that
you got the boss all fired up.


01:13:01.931 --> 01:13:03.523
Shut up.


01:13:06.068 --> 01:13:07.558
Come on, Ami.


01:13:09.472 --> 01:13:10.598
Let's go!


01:13:51.614 --> 01:13:54.082
What? You actually came?


01:13:54.817 --> 01:13:56.842
My parents are angry.


01:13:57.086 --> 01:14:00.647
Why don't you just die
before you complicate things?


01:14:03.359 --> 01:14:05.327
What? You little punk!


01:14:07.196 --> 01:14:09.858
Huh? What's this?


01:14:42.832 --> 01:14:44.356
Ryota...


01:14:44.467 --> 01:14:46.697
Tomokazu...


01:14:47.236 --> 01:14:48.999
Takashi...


01:14:49.905 --> 01:14:50.872
Yoshio...


01:14:50.940 --> 01:14:51.998
Ryota...


01:14:52.108 --> 01:14:53.769
Tomokazu...


01:14:54.643 --> 01:14:56.167
Takashi...


01:15:08.023 --> 01:15:10.924
I'll give you credit for coming this far.


01:15:12.027 --> 01:15:16.191
I'll do whatever
it takes to protect our son!


01:15:18.234 --> 01:15:24.901
You're not the only ones who can
become demons for your families.


01:15:26.609 --> 01:15:28.236
Listen!


01:15:31.447 --> 01:15:39.752
We have gathered to punish
you for our sons' deaths.


01:15:40.623 --> 01:15:43.820
We're the Super Mourner Gang!


01:15:46.295 --> 01:15:50.391
Shit... You bastards...


01:15:51.600 --> 01:15:54.535
Feel the wrath of my son!


01:16:10.052 --> 01:16:11.041
Ami!


01:16:37.646 --> 01:16:40.740
You killed my son!


01:16:41.183 --> 01:16:42.445
Give him back!


01:16:47.523 --> 01:16:51.084
No way.
Bulletproof vests under the pictures...


01:17:44.914 --> 01:17:45.972
Takashi!


01:18:01.163 --> 01:18:03.290
Tomokazu! I'm sorry!


01:18:36.165 --> 01:18:37.496
I'm out of bullets.


01:19:04.660 --> 01:19:06.628
Wrong target.


01:19:10.032 --> 01:19:12.000
Thanks for waiting, Ami.


01:19:13.635 --> 01:19:16.331
Do you think you can kill me?


01:19:16.972 --> 01:19:19.941
My most deadly ninja weapon.


01:19:20.409 --> 01:19:22.969
The executioner's blade. Take this!


01:20:22.071 --> 01:20:23.538
Takashi...


01:20:26.975 --> 01:20:28.067
Ami.


01:20:42.825 --> 01:20:44.850
Here we go! Take this!


01:21:17.860 --> 01:21:19.020
Miki!


01:21:20.696 --> 01:21:22.027
Miki!


01:21:28.937 --> 01:21:30.063
Ami...


01:21:30.973 --> 01:21:32.998
Don't worry about me...


01:21:33.242 --> 01:21:35.073
Kill the Kimuras.


01:21:35.677 --> 01:21:39.738
You have to kill them for me!


01:21:47.523 --> 01:21:50.788
I've chopped off such a useless thing.


01:21:53.028 --> 01:21:56.122
In a matter of minutes, you will die.


01:21:56.431 --> 01:22:00.367
Then you won't be able
to hold a grudge against me.


01:22:01.003 --> 01:22:03.995
But if you still want to kill me,


01:22:04.940 --> 01:22:07.033
then come this way!


01:22:11.079 --> 01:22:13.707
How dare you do this to Miki...


01:22:15.184 --> 01:22:16.276
Miki...


01:22:18.654 --> 01:22:20.087
Go...


01:22:38.440 --> 01:22:42.467
Die in front of our great Hanzo's spirit!


01:23:00.128 --> 01:23:02.323
You will perish.


01:23:03.732 --> 01:23:06.929
Apologize to the great
Hanzo in the afterlife!


01:23:21.350 --> 01:23:22.840
Sho...


01:23:24.720 --> 01:23:28.121
I couldn't protect you...


01:23:34.263 --> 01:23:37.926
Take that, you brutal yakuza.


01:23:41.903 --> 01:23:43.530
Ami... Ami...


01:23:44.139 --> 01:23:47.472
l-I... I'm coming...


01:23:47.542 --> 01:23:49.874
You're not going anywhere!


01:24:17.372 --> 01:24:19.533
Ryota!


01:24:21.643 --> 01:24:23.440
Ryota!


01:24:37.292 --> 01:24:39.283
Ami!


01:24:42.998 --> 01:24:45.728
Don't let them beat you!


01:25:10.625 --> 01:25:11.717
Miki...


01:25:17.999 --> 01:25:22.026
Miki, I wish I could join you...


01:25:23.438 --> 01:25:26.703
But I want you to wait for me...


01:25:27.476 --> 01:25:29.706
Sho Kimura's still in the main hall...


01:25:31.046 --> 01:25:36.484
I can't die until I take his head.


01:25:51.733 --> 01:25:54.497
Missy, I'm over here.


01:25:54.603 --> 01:25:57.367
l-I'm scared... I'm scared...


01:26:00.909 --> 01:26:03.469
I'm using these three as my shield.


01:26:03.578 --> 01:26:07.275
If you want to kill me, go ahead.
But they're going to die too.


01:26:09.651 --> 01:26:11.619
You're such a coward.


01:26:17.159 --> 01:26:22.358
A ninja does whatever
it takes to survive.


01:26:24.699 --> 01:26:29.932
Sho is much more of
a ninja than his father was.


01:26:32.174 --> 01:26:34.904
That's because I raised him right.


01:26:36.478 --> 01:26:38.207
You stupid bitch.


01:26:39.581 --> 01:26:44.075
A person without love
can't possibly love their child!


01:27:08.777 --> 01:27:11.837
No way...
The chainsaw was deflected?


01:27:12.514 --> 01:27:13.947
I'm sorry.


01:27:14.316 --> 01:27:17.251
I'm wearing a special bra.


01:27:18.453 --> 01:27:20.216
A steel one.


01:27:20.322 --> 01:27:21.619
A drill bra.


01:27:24.526 --> 01:27:26.153
It can't be...


01:27:26.328 --> 01:27:29.263
Yes, it can be.


01:27:33.835 --> 01:27:36.303
What do you think of it?


01:27:44.813 --> 01:27:46.144
Enjoy my drill.


01:28:03.565 --> 01:28:04.793
Well?


01:28:23.151 --> 01:28:24.243
Well?


01:28:24.753 --> 01:28:27.221
How do you like my drill bra?


01:28:32.327 --> 01:28:35.160
Now I'll drill your face.


01:28:49.144 --> 01:28:51.078
I'm scared... I'm scared...


01:29:31.086 --> 01:29:32.144
Mom!


01:29:32.387 --> 01:29:33.445
Sho!


01:29:36.758 --> 01:29:38.282
Are you okay?


01:29:42.731 --> 01:29:45.564
This is for the ones you killed!


01:30:08.823 --> 01:30:11.792
Your love turned out to be harmful...


01:30:11.893 --> 01:30:14.691
I hope you both rot in hell!


01:30:26.975 --> 01:30:31.742
Listen up. Go down
the mountain and get some help.


01:30:32.914 --> 01:30:37.647
Find the police and tell them
that lots of people have been killed,


01:30:38.019 --> 01:30:40.852
and that a girl named Ami Hyuga did it.


01:30:41.556 --> 01:30:42.818
Go on.


01:30:43.558 --> 01:30:46.652
Even if you get bullied,
don't let them win.


01:30:46.961 --> 01:30:48.053
Promise?


01:30:48.763 --> 01:30:52.995
Yeah, I'll be strong like you one day.


01:31:09.684 --> 01:31:11.914
It's over, Yu.


01:31:13.555 --> 01:31:15.580
I'm such a stupid sister.


01:31:16.224 --> 01:31:19.682
You probably have nothing
but contempt for me now.


01:31:33.575 --> 01:31:35.007
Yu...
